# a key held across the bar used to be cut at the bar line (no rest of the note, no release).
# the pass keeps it to the end; the next pass keeps the rest from 0 until the key is let go.
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
turn SELECT 2
wait 100
expect track 4
expect eng 11
setbars 0 1
qnt 0
lat 0
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap REC
wait 40
key w0 down 100
wait 4500
key w0 up
wait 200
tap REC
wait 400
dumpclip
expect events >1
expect evdur >100

